 "text": "Hey, good to have you along. How are you? Definitely. Lots of people do it. Which end of something you need for your chair, and have it with you when you get up. A small bag under the pillow is hardly noticeable. Then put it there every night. A habit forms quickly. You' lose that feeling within months. You' be surprised how little a chair rocks whereas your bed doesn't. Keep it on the chair or under one arm if you use one armrest. You' get quick at getting it out and back without it interrupting you.",
